// case/given/elem/take.id): the element is what the call is made with, so the
// export is held to what `(import NAME)` whole is, at the list type of the
// parameter, and the index is a literal or a conf.id constant -- an export's
// own value as an index would be read after the call and could agree with the
// case by construction.

